                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How long does a fashion app take to build?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: 12-16 weeks. Growth build with AR / size-fit / personalization: 18-26 weeks. Enterprise multi-region: 28-40 weeks.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build native or React Native?</h3>
                                        <p>React Native for most fashion brands — it hits 90%+ native feel at 40-60% of native cost. Go native only if you have complex AR, camera-first flows, or offline requirements.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does virtual try-on cost to add?</h3>
                                        <p>Accessory AR try-on (rings, glasses, earrings): $8K-25K via Perfect Corp / MirrAR APIs. Apparel virtual try-on is more expensive ($25K-120K) and less mature — most brands wait for the tech to improve.</p>
                                        <h3>Is a fashion app worth building if I have a strong mobile web store?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if your monthly mobile-web AOV is above ~₹2,500 / $30 and you have >30K monthly buyers. Apps typically lift AOV 15-30% and repeat rate 2-4x, which usually pays back build cost in 6-14 months.</p>
